# Drift Shop is cloud-only: it always boots against Supabase.
# Both vars are REQUIRED at build time. A build made without them renders an
# honest "cloud backend is not configured" screen instead of the app.
#
# Setup path (see README.md "First-run setup & master account"):
#   1. Create a free project at supabase.com -> Dashboard -> New project.
#   2. In the SQL editor run supabase/migrations/ 001-056 in order
#      (056 creates the master admin account: username "admin").
#   3. Copy this project's URL and anon key (Project Settings -> API) below.
#   4. npm install && npm run build, then deploy dist/ to any static host.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://xyzcompany.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...
